{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>WorkoutSpot 是一款運動分析工具，可讓你逐點或逐段檢視已記錄的訓練，瞭解爬坡、衝刺與各項表現數據，適合想深入檢討訓練內容的跑手及單車愛好者。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-128.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>逐段分析運動數據</h2>\n<p>WorkoutSpot 可讀取 Health 內的運動記錄，並分析由 Apple Watch 或其他相容 App 加入的訓練。在圖表上縮放或平移即可選取路段，查看地圖標示、時間、距離、爬升、平均坡度、速度、心率與功率；切換時間或距離顯示時仍會保留選取範圍。點選圖表上的位置，亦可查看該處的地點、海拔與時間。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：WorkoutSpot</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/workoutspot/id1529681363?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.531998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T21:15:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:28.722254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.895961+00:00","content_hash":"bd02e86d735ba8b9073966b9f997af86fba1d2e258d163668bd3363420bcb654","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}